Z||000001||80's BOY||06-02-2000||01:03 PM||||it sounds like you need to buy a cooler fan temp switch. mine's from hypertech, and it works great. if you are looking at the car from the pass side of the engine, behind the  coolant fill neck, there are two electric switches. i THINK it's the on on the right. not quite sure. other people might remember better then me, but it is one of those for sure.||||reg||1
